# Store and check out every text file with LF on all platforms, whatever core.autocrlf is set to.
# Git detects binary files automatically. The list below makes the common ones explicit.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.webm binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.pdf binary
*.ps2 binary
*.max binary
*.fbx binary
